 <section className="service-process section-pad"><div className="section-shell"><SectionIntro label="OUR PROCESS" title="A clear process designed to deliver smarter financial outcomes"/><div className="service-process-grid">{[['Initial consultation','A detailed discussion to understand your financial position and identify the right strategies for success.',assets.serviceProcess1],['Financial assessment','We assess your financial goals, resources, and performance to develop effective strategies for long-term success.',assets.serviceProcess2],['Strategy development','Developing data-driven strategies to improve performance, optimize resources, and achieve long-term success.',assets.serviceProcess3],['Implementation & ongoing support','We help execute financial strategies effectively while offering ongoing support to adapt and achieve future goals.',assets.serviceProcess4]].map(([t,b,img],i)=><article key={t} data-reveal><span>0{i+1}</span><div className="inner-image"><img src={img} alt={t}/></div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{b}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
