 <section className="inner-cta section-shell"><div className="inner-image"><img src={assets.pricingCTA} alt="Financial partners planning together"/></div><div data-reveal><span className="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT STEP</span><h2>Discover better strategies for sustainable growth</h2><p>Unlock smarter financial solutions with expert guidance and strategic planning that helps your business achieve consistent, sustainable growth.</p><Link to="/contact" className="button button-dark">Get in touch <ArrowUpRight/></Link></div></section>
